          "desc": "32 active CDNA 4 Compute Units per XCD (8x4 grid shown; symbolic layout). Each CU holds Matrix Cores (MFMA), vector/scalar ALUs, a 32 KB L1 vector cache and 160 KB of Local Data Share. Click **Open CU** to look inside.",
